%% Activity Diagram — Resume Architect flow (upload → classify → tailor → export)
flowchart TD
    Start([● Start]) --> Choice{Resume source?}
    Choice -->|Upload PDF| Upload[/Upload existing resume PDF/]
    Choice -->|Build in-app| Build[Fill profile-based resume builder]
    Upload --> Extract[Extract text from PDF]
    Extract --> Valid{Text extracted OK?}
    Valid -->|No| Err[Show error: unreadable file] --> Choice
    Valid -->|Yes| M1[["🧠 Model 1: classify resume<br/>→ category + top-3 confidence"]]
    Build --> M1
    M1 --> Save[(Save master resume<br/>+ predicted category)]
    Save --> Align{Category matches<br/>target role?}
    Align -->|No| Warn[Show alignment warning<br/>+ suggest skill gap analysis]
    Align -->|Yes| Pick[User selects target job posting]
    Warn --> Pick
    Pick --> Tailor[Generate tailored version<br/>ATS keyword optimization - Gemini]
    Tailor --> ATS[Compute ATS score]
    ATS --> Review{User approves?}
    Review -->|Edit| Tailor
    Review -->|Yes| Export[/Export as PDF/]
    Export --> SaveT[(Save tailored resume<br/>linked to job_id)]
    SaveT --> End([◉ End])
